        "original_id": "3a8a57ad-f462-5a66-bed9-695740c52dd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Vintage Life, InStyle\n- Companies: Dragoon Publishing, Time Inc.\n- People: Rachel Egglestone-Evans, Sarah Kate Ellis\n- Roles: editor, media executive\n- Topics: fashion magazines, lifestyle magazines, vintage fashion\n\nFacts:\n- InStyle was founded in 1994.\n- Vintage Life is a British glossy fashion and lifestyle magazine published by Dragoon Publishing.\n- Vintage Life focuses on vintage fashion and lifestyle from the 1920s to the 1970s.\n- InStyle is a monthly women’s fashion magazine published in the United States by Time Inc.\n- Rachel \"Rae\" Evans was born on 6 September 1980 in Congleton, Cheshire, England.\n- Rachel Egglestone-Evans is the editor of Vintage Life Magazine.\n- Sarah Kate Ellis was born on November 27, 1971.\n- Sarah Kate Ellis is an American media executive known for launching and turning around media brands including New York, InStyle, Real Simple, and Vogue.",
